  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(1 + tan 75°) / (1 - tan 75°)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\ntan(75°) = tan(45° + 30°) = (tan 45° + tan 30°) / (1 - tan 45° × tan 30°)\n\ntan 45° = 1 and tan 30° = 1/√3\n\n**Calculation:**\n\ntan 75° = (1 + 1/√3) / (1 - 1 × 1/√3)\n\ntan 75° = (√3 + 1) / (√3 - 1)\n\n(1 + tan 75°) / (1 - tan 75°) = (1 + ((√3 + 1) / (√3 - 1))) / (1 - ((√3 + 1) / (√3 - 1)))\n\nNumerator = 1 + ((√3 + 1) / (√3 - 1)) = (√3 - 1 + √3 + 1) / (√3 - 1) = (2√3) / (√3 - 1)\n\nDenominator = 1 - ((√3 + 1) / (√3 - 1)) = (√3 - 1 - √3 - 1) / (√3 - 1) = -2 / (√3 - 1)\n\n(Numerator / Denominator) = ((2√3) / (√3 - 1)) / ((-2) / (√3 - 1))\n\n= (2√3) / -2 = -√3\n\n**∴ The value of (1 + tan 75°) / (1 - tan 75°) is -√3.**",
